    "detailed_description": "<h1>This game has been developed by a single developer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700300/extras/5fe7f36af0d8af25236b8df1b9555fbf.avif?t=1741127227\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only with your help we can adapt, improve the game, and overcome many of its development challenges. Together we can create the game we all want to play! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the official World Warfare and Economics Discord server to share your ideas, feedback, and stay on top of the latest news!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rule Any Nation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of any country and lead it through the ever-changing tides of history. Whether you guide a global superpower, a growing regional force, or a small nation struggling for survival, your leadership will determine its future. Will you expand your influence through diplomacy and trade, or will you dominate through military strength? Every decision shapes your country's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700300/extras/df78bae2f81cd93d2efc77be62d971e6.poster.avif?t=1741127227\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700300/extras/df78bae2f81cd93d2efc77be62d971e6.webm?t=1741127227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700300/extras/df78bae2f81cd93d2efc77be62d971e6.mp4?t=1741127227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Economic Mastery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A strong economy is the backbone of any successful nation. Manage your country\u2019s <strong>resources, taxes, trade agreements, and GDP growth</strong> to ensure financial stability. Develop industries, invest in infrastructure, and decide how much government control to exert over the economy. Will you create a capitalist powerhouse, a centrally planned economy, or something in between? Adapt to global market shifts and economic crises as you build your nation\u2019s financial future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700300/extras/46ad15502d79c5ecce056140c47ff7a2.poster.avif?t=1741127227\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700300/extras/46ad15502d79c5ecce056140c47ff7a2.webm?t=1741127227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Diplomacy &amp; Geopolitics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is a complex web of alliances, treaties, and rivalries. Send envoys to negotiate trade deals, establish diplomatic relations, and secure international support. Join <strong>intergovernmental organizations (IGOs)</strong> like the United Nations, sign <strong>defense pacts</strong>, or forge secret agreements to outmaneuver your opponents. React to global events, respond to diplomatic crises, and decide whether to build lasting peace or escalate tensions for strategic gain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700300/extras/8803f32c6c3fd0743e64fc676f0e972a.poster.avif?t=1741127227\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700300/extras/8803f32c6c3fd0743e64fc676f0e972a.webm?t=1741127227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Real-Time Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in large-scale battles where strategy and tactics determine the outcome. Command armies on land, air, and sea, deploying your forces with precision in <strong>real-time combat</strong>. Plan offensives, fortify defenses, and utilize modern military technology to outmaneuver your enemies. Logistics, supply chains, and battlefield conditions all play a crucial role\u2014will you be a careful strategist or a relentless conqueror?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700300/extras/7cb11d6bd5d9452b348b5c11c40c9199.poster.avif?t=1741127227\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700300/extras/7cb11d6bd5d9452b348b5c11c40c9199.webm?t=1741127227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700300/extras/7cb11d6bd5d9452b348b5c11c40c9199.mp4?t=1741127227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic World Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world doesn\u2019t stand still. From <strong>natural disasters</strong> that threaten global economies to <strong>sports championships</strong> that unite (or divide) nations, history unfolds in real-time. Political revolutions, stock market crashes, and scientific breakthroughs will challenge your leadership. Will you seize opportunities to strengthen your position, or will global crises force you into difficult decisions? Every playthrough is shaped by an evolving world full of surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700300/extras/fb58e99aec4de8cdffb175ec03de5b22.poster.avif?t=1741127227\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700300/extras/fb58e99aec4de8cdffb175ec03de5b22.webm?t=1741127227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rule Any Nation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of any country and lead it through the ever-changing tides of history. Whether you guide a global superpower, a growing regional force, or a small nation struggling for survival, your leadership will determine its future. Will you expand your influence through diplomacy and trade, or will you dominate through military strength? Every decision shapes your country's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700300/extras/df78bae2f81cd93d2efc77be62d971e6.poster.avif?t=1741127227\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700300/extras/df78bae2f81cd93d2efc77be62d971e6.webm?t=1741127227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700300/extras/df78bae2f81cd93d2efc77be62d971e6.mp4?t=1741127227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Economic Mastery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A strong economy is the backbone of any successful nation. Manage your country\u2019s <strong>resources, taxes, trade agreements, and GDP growth</strong> to ensure financial stability. Develop industries, invest in infrastructure, and decide how much government control to exert over the economy. Will you create a capitalist powerhouse, a centrally planned economy, or something in between? Adapt to global market shifts and economic crises as you build your nation\u2019s financial future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700300/extras/46ad15502d79c5ecce056140c47ff7a2.poster.avif?t=1741127227\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700300/extras/46ad15502d79c5ecce056140c47ff7a2.webm?t=1741127227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Diplomacy &amp; Geopolitics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is a complex web of alliances, treaties, and rivalries. Send envoys to negotiate trade deals, establish diplomatic relations, and secure international support. Join <strong>intergovernmental organizations (IGOs)</strong> like the United Nations, sign <strong>defense pacts</strong>, or forge secret agreements to outmaneuver your opponents. React to global events, respond to diplomatic crises, and decide whether to build lasting peace or escalate tensions for strategic gain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700300/extras/8803f32c6c3fd0743e64fc676f0e972a.poster.avif?t=1741127227\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700300/extras/8803f32c6c3fd0743e64fc676f0e972a.webm?t=1741127227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Real-Time Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in large-scale battles where strategy and tactics determine the outcome. Command armies on land, air, and sea, deploying your forces with precision in <strong>real-time combat</strong>. Plan offensives, fortify defenses, and utilize modern military technology to outmaneuver your enemies. Logistics, supply chains, and battlefield conditions all play a crucial role\u2014will you be a careful strategist or a relentless conqueror?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700300/extras/7cb11d6bd5d9452b348b5c11c40c9199.poster.avif?t=1741127227\" ><source src=\"https://